BaseSettler_settlePremium
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it should no-op via the ERC-6909 short-circuit and return true
├── when debitFrom has sufficient balance AND dual-auth passes
│   └── it should debit via ERC6909.settle, IERC20.safeTransfer to cellar, and emit Settled
├── when debitFrom balance is less than amount
│   └── it should revert with InsufficientBalance
├── when msg.sender is not authorized by debitFrom
│   └── it should revert with UnauthorizedSettler
├── when premiumFiller is not authorized by debitFrom
│   └── it should revert with UnauthorizedPremiumFiller
└── when the ERC-6909 internal IERC20.safeTransfer reverts
    └── it should revert with the bubbled transfer error and leave ERC-6909 balance unchanged
